window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The breathtaking story that has enthralled audiences from around the world, </b><b><i>The Ancestors Saga</i></b><b> continues with Book three,</b><b><i> Enemy Tribe.</i></b></p> <p><i>Betrayed. Captured. Terrified.</i></p> <p>The forests of home lie far behind. Nyriaana is now the captive of Khalvir, the Wove raider she mistakenly trusted with her life. Gripped by the agony of betrayal and the dire consequences her naïvety wrought, the thirst for revenge alone keeps Nyriaana breathing.</p> <p>Surrounded by predators, both human and animal alike, not everything is as it seems in this vast and perilous world beyond her homeland. Nyriaana must learn who to trust and learn fast if she is to survive the journey through enemy territory. </p> <p>One misstep and she will fall into the clutches of the mysterious chief who awaits her arrival...</p>"; 
